Three new Acts appended after level 63 (no re-keying of existing chapters):
- Act VII · Candles & Doji (64-75): doji quartet + four-price, spinning top,
  hammer/hanging man, shooting star/inverted hammer, engulfing, morning/evening star
- Act VIII · Chart Patterns (76-89): bull/bear flag, asc/desc channel, 3x triangle,
  rising/falling wedge, pennant, double top/bottom, H&S + inverse — click-to-build
- Act IX · Advanced & Smart Money (90-100): Wyckoff accum/distrib, Elliott impulse+
  correction, PO3/AMD, order block, FVG, liquidity sweep, BOS/CHoCH, harmonic, capstone

Wired into CAMPAIGN_CHAPTERS + SCRIPTS (click-guided coach) + CR_CH_DISPLAY + campaign
map cards. _CAMPAIGN_MAX 70->107, CR_CAMPAIGN_CLAIMABLE 67->104. All playable now
(pure charting, no phase2 lock). Full host script passes node --check.

